OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate alleged assault
OL,4,Aafter Enoch Burke confronts church
OL,5,Aleader after funeral
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are investigating a report of an
OL,8,Fassault following an incident involving
OL,9,FEnoch Burke and the head of the Church
OL,10,Fof Ireland.
OL,12,FA video posted on social media by
OL,13,Fformer teacher Burke shows him
OL,14,Fconfronting and grabbing the arm of
OL,15,FArchbishop of Armagh and Primate of All
OL,16,FIreland John McDowell.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the church said
OL,19,FBurke and members of his family
OL,20,Fapproached the archbishop following a
OL,21,Ffuneral service at St Patrick's Church
OL,22,Fof Ireland Cathedral on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
